    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jorge is kind of a dick, but now he's forced by circumstances to act like a responsible adult. So he finds a good job in a multinational company, which he's really happy about... until he finds out that he will have to work with four of his exes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this romantic comedy in an office setting, you'll help Jorge interact with his exes on a daily basis, while trying to clean his karma and make up for all the crap he used to do to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857660/extras/a0921d4e5d58800291c9d90af290d8dc.avif?t=1743018738\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857660/extras/c10a787f01bb9f7efc1013362c056abc.avif?t=1743018738\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857660/extras/ed61576e787de01a21c6b7701d994b48.avif?t=1743018738\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857660/extras/2aa732661d5a459d25b6e7026d83191c.avif?t=1743018738\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857660/extras/ff20c2f3ebce940263f4278f3e8ff950.avif?t=1743018738\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The<strong> Early Access version</strong> of <i>Exes Assault!!</i> features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Gabriel, Jacob, and Ivaan's routes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* 225k words. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Many cutscene illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Business trips, dates, and a waterpark special event! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Chat with the potential boyfriends and get closer to them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For the full version, we are planning on: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Kevin's route. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* A polyamory route with Jacob and Gabriel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's also a DLC in the works, so keep tuned for updates!</p>",
